sequenceDiagram
    participant browser as React
    participant backend as NestJS
    participant database as Application database
    participant ai as FastAPI
    participant vector as Qdrant
    participant model as Ollama
    browser->>backend: POST /conversations/:id/messages/stream
    backend->>backend: Authenticate and authorize conversation
    backend->>database: Save user message and pending assistant message
    backend->>ai: POST /internal/chat/stream with trusted scope
    ai->>model: Embed retrieval query
    model-->>ai: Query vector
    ai->>vector: SDK search with tenant and access filters
    vector-->>ai: Authorized policy chunks and source IDs
    ai->>model: POST /api/chat with context and allowed tool schema
    model-->>ai: Proposed get_order arguments
    ai->>ai: Validate schema and remaining tool budget
    ai->>backend: POST /internal/tools/get-order
    backend->>backend: Verify service identity and original user scope
    backend->>database: Read authorized order facts
    database-->>backend: Current order state
    backend-->>ai: Minimal tool result
    ai->>model: POST /api/chat with evidence and tool result
    loop Answer generation
        model-->>ai: Answer content
        ai-->>backend: NDJSON delta
        backend-->>browser: Forward delta through public proxy
    end
    ai-->>backend: Completion with validated source IDs
    backend->>database: Persist final answer and citations
    backend-->>browser: Terminal done with durable message ID
